  s07: <
    handle: "custom-path/07"
    type: "custom-path"
    excerpt: "When he moved, he did not walk. He was in one place, and then in the next place along, as if the day were being told in pictures and somebody had skipped the ones in between. Then a pause. Then the next picture. Boof ..."
    route: ^[chapter/14/s07]{open}
  >
  s08: {
    handle: "section/08"
    type: "section"
    title: "Friday"
    excerpt: "It was Friday before Boof had finished blinking. Below the rise, in the farms along the road, latches lifted. Smoke stood up from three chimneys at once. A bucket knocked a well and somebody swore at the cold — cheerf..."
